      "content": "That's a good start, it definitely feels luxurious. But looking at the backend, the score for that draft was a bit lower than I was hoping for—it didn't really hit the 'high richness' threshold we need for the homepage. \n\nCan you try an expanded version? I need more depth. Don't worry about being too wordy, just focus on making it incredibly descriptive. Just please don't just list adjectives like a dictionary; keep it sounding professional and elegant, but definitely aim for a much higher adjective density so the SEO tool picks it up. Try to really push that score higher.",
